श्वेतखदिर|श्वेतखदिरः
श्वेतखदिर m. (-रः) A white variety of the Mimosa catechu.<BR> E. श्वेत, and<BR>खदिर the Khayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=738-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतगज|श्वेतगजः
श्वेतगज m. (-जः)<BR>	 1. A white elephant.<BR>	 2. Airāvata, the elephant of<BR>INDRA.<BR> E. श्वेत white, and गज an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=738-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

