श्वेतधामन्
श्वेतधामन् m. (-मा)<BR>	 1. The moon.<BR>	 2. Camphor.<BR>	 3. Cuttle-fish-bone. E.<BR>श्वेत white, धामन् a ray.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=738-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतनील|श्वेतनीलः
श्वेतनील m. (-लः) A cloud.<BR> E. श्वेत white, and नील black or dark blue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=738-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

