श्वेतपत्र m. (-त्रः) A goose.<BR> E. श्वेत white, पत्र a feather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=SHS&page=738-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=shs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

